Flow Steward MongoDB extension
Copyright 2026 Flow Steward contributors

This extension packages a modified Google MCP Toolbox for Databases v1.3.0,
commit b0010060a939455d91e4f8ba62dc3e72b1892469.
Copyright Google LLC; licensed under Apache-2.0 (included in LICENSE).
Source: https://github.com/googleapis/mcp-toolbox

The checked-in source patch adds bounded integration support: literal payloads,
canonical Extended JSON results, complete write counters, ordered sorting,
missing-document handling, disabled automatic retries and a DNS-pinned network
policy for discovered MongoDB endpoints. Only MongoDB source and tool packages
are registered. Build pins and patch accompany the package; native checksums
are recorded in toolbox-provenance.json and SHA256SUMS.

The icon is official MongoDB brand artwork; see BRAND-ASSETS.md for its source. This project
is not affiliated with MongoDB, Inc. MongoDB is a trademark of its owner.
